---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
	path="/about"
	title="About"
	description={`About ${SITE.name}: a free, unlimited, no-account font identifier that matches fonts from images using AI and browser-side comparison.`}
	canonical="/about"
>
	<section class="container-page py-12 sm:py-16">
		<div class="container-prose">
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
			<h1 class="mt-3 text-display-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Naming fonts should be free</h1>
			<div class="prose mt-6">
				<p>
					Fonts Finder AI started with a small, frustrating problem: we kept seeing typefaces we loved
					and had no quick way to name them. Existing tools charged per identification, hid results
					behind accounts, or ignored commercial fonts entirely.
				</p>
				<p>
					So we built the tool we wanted. Upload an image, and an AI vision model reads the text while
					your browser compares letterforms against 1,800+ free fonts and hundreds of commercial ones.
					Results come back ranked, in seconds, for free.
				</p>
				<p>
					We believe a font identification tool should be like the fonts themselves: freely available,
					beautifully crafted, and open to everyone. No accounts. No credits. No dark patterns.
				</p>
				<p>
					When we do find a commercial font, we pair it with a free alternative that looks remarkably
					close — because the answer “you need to buy a $60 license” is never the only answer.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-6 text-center">
					<p class="text-display-md font-semibold">1,800+</p>
					<p class="text-body-sm text-mute">free fonts in our database</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-6 text-center">
					<p class="text-display-md font-semibold">300+</p>
					<p class="text-body-sm text-mute">commercial typefaces covered</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-6 text-center">
					<p class="text-display-md font-semibold">$0</p>
					<p class="text-body-sm text-mute">always — it’s free forever</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<p class="mt-10 text-body-md text-body">
				Questions or feedback? <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="/contact">Contact us</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>